From 4e68e23ce9fa0c0ef1a2a6d594cd2a2180663a11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HuaWen CHEN <quic_huawenc@quicinc.com>
Date: Fri, 15 Mar 2024 13:11:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] odhcpd: add support legacy_prefix_delgation

introduce new UCI option legacy_prefix_delegation_mode.
when it is enabled,
odhcpd will query prefix delegation by pd_manager when receive RS,
and send delegated-prefix in RA message.

Change-Id: I6fbc2a2649d2426d79d1e68c12f39b3b132ba4d3
Signed-off-by: HuaWen CHEN <quic_huawenc@quicinc.com>
